[{"id":"951496140968480768","date":1515689332000,"rawContent":"Even when pressed by the demands of inner truth, men do not easily assume the task of opposing their government's policy, especially in time of war. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":1,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951496143006871552","date":1515689333000,"rawContent":"Nor does the human spirit move without great difficulty against all the apathy of conformist thought within one's own bosom and in the surrounding world. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951496942743252992","date":1515689523000,"rawContent":"Some of us who have already begun to break the silence of the night have found that the calling to speak is often a vocation of agony, but we must speak. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":3,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951497077384658944","date":1515689555000,"rawContent":"Perhaps a new spirit is rising among us. If it is, let us trace its movement well and pray that our own inner being may be sensitive to its guidance, for we are deeply in need of a new way beyond the darkness that seems so close around us. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":4,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951497985250086914","date":1515689772000,"rawContent":"Nor is it an attempt to overlook the ambiguity of the total situation and the need for a collective solution to the tragedy of [our deeply patriarchal and racist society]. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":5,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951498444622807040","date":1515689881000,"rawContent":"Neither is it an attempt to... overlook the role [especially white men] can play in a successful resolution of the problem. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951498875558178816","date":1515689984000,"rawContent":"While they both may have justifiable reason to be suspicious of the good faith of [women and minorities], life and history give eloquent testimony to the fact that conflicts are never resolved without trustful give and take on both sides. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951499975397015552","date":1515690246000,"rawContent":"I knew that America would never invest the necessary funds or energies in rehabilitation of its poor so long as adventures like [tax breaks, bonuses, voter suppression, etc] continued to draw men and skills and money like some demonic destructive suction tube. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951499977028718592","date":1515690247000,"rawContent":"So I was increasingly compelled to see [sexism and racism] as an enemy of the poor and to attack it as such. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":9.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951501582419468289","date":1515690629000,"rawContent":"Perhaps the more tragic recognition of reality took place when it became clear to me that the [racist and class] war [on drugs] was doing far more than devastating the hopes of the poor at home. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":10,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":10.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951501583539347456","date":1515690630000,"rawContent":"It was sending their sons and their brothers and their husbands to [prison] in extraordinarily high proportions relative to the rest of the population. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":11,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":11.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951501585472937985","date":1515690630000,"rawContent":"We were taking the black young men who had been crippled by our society and sending them... away to   [prisons with moderated book lists in] southwest Georgia and East Harlem. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":12,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":12.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951503179425882112","date":1515691010000,"rawContent":"Now it should be incandescently clear that no one who has any concern for the integrity and life of America today can ignore the present [tidal wave of wxmen speaking out against patriarchy&amp; minorities against racist&amp;homophobic&amp;transphobic policies of their society].#TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":13,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":13.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951506485313335296","date":1515691798000,"rawContent":"If America's soul becomes totally poisoned, part of the autopsy must read [white supremacist patriarchy]. It can never be saved so long as it destroys the deepest hopes of [wxmen and minorities] the world over. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":14,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":14.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951506982686486529","date":1515691917000,"rawContent":"This is a calling that takes me beyond national allegiances, but even if it were not present I would yet have to live with the meaning of my commitment to the ministry of Jesus Christ. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":15,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":15.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951509492578992129","date":1515692515000,"rawContent":"To me the relationship of this ministry to the making of peace [&amp; equality&amp; well being of people] is so obvious that I sometimes marvel at those who ask me why I am speaking against the [status quo]. Could it be that they do not know that [America] was meant for all [people]#BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":16,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":16.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951510466945196032","date":1515692748000,"rawContent":"This I believe to be the privilege and the burden of all of us who deem ourselves bound by allegiances and loyalties which are broader and deeper than nationalism [and politics] and which go beyond our nation's self-defined goals and positions. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":17,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":17.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951510639205277696","date":1515692789000,"rawContent":"We are called to speak for the weak, for the voiceless, for victims of our nation and for those it calls enemy, for no document from human hands can make these humans any less our brothers [and sisters]. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":18.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":18,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":18.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951514974861516800","date":1515693822000,"rawContent":"I speak now not of the [Democratic and Republican politicians] of each side, [nor the CEOs of enourmous companies or wealthy investors]. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":19.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":19,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":19.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951514973691289600","date":1515693822000,"rawContent":"And as I ponder the madness of [our current political climate] and search within myself for ways to understand and respond to compassion my mind goes constantly to the [common] people of [this country]. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":20.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":20,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":20.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951514976698724352","date":1515693823000,"rawContent":"But simply of the people who have been living under the curse of [racist, sexist, homophobic, completely dysfunctional, and unrepresentative government] for... [twenty] continuous decades now. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":21.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":21,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":21.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951514978409836544","date":1515693823000,"rawContent":"I think of them too because it is clear to me that there will be no meaningful solution there until some attempt is made to know them and hear their broken cries. #TimesUp #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":22.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":22,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":22.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951530649260720128","date":1515697560000,"rawContent":"Here is the true meaning and value of compassion and nonviolence when it helps us to see the [supressed] point of view, to hear [their] questions, to know [their] assessment of ourselves [who are in a position of privilege]. #timesup #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":23.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":23,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":23.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951530895973924864","date":1515697618000,"rawContent":"For from [this outside] view we may indeed see the basic weaknesses of our own condition, and if we are mature, we may learn and grow and profit from the wisdom of the brothers [and sisters] who are called the opposition. #timesup #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":24.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":24,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":24.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951532154059542528","date":1515697918000,"rawContent":"At this point I should make it clear that while I have tried in these last few minutes to give a voice to the voiceless on [issues of social justice] and to understand the arguments of those who are called [feminazis and terrorists]... #timesup #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":25.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":25.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951532155481473025","date":1515697919000,"rawContent":"I am as deeply concerned about [the economically ravaged poor of the South that are consistently manipulated into policies fed false propaganda that hurts them particularly] #timesup #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":26.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":26,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":26.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951533296864911360","date":1515698191000,"rawContent":"For it occurs to me that what [their own party is] submitting them to [economic hardships with no end] is not simply the brutalizing process that goes on in any [economic downturn as their prime industries are slowly eliminated]. #timesup #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":27.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":27,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":27.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951533298584465408","date":1515698191000,"rawContent":"We are adding cynicism to the process of [poverty] for they must know after a short period there that none of the things [Republicans] claim to be fighting for are really involved. #MeToo #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":28.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":28,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":28.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951534033581649921","date":1515698366000,"rawContent":"Before long they must know that their government has sent them into a struggle [of demonizing all progressives, labeling any negative media as fake news]... #MeToo #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":29.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":3,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":29.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951534035028795392","date":1515698367000,"rawContent":"...and the more sophisticated surely realize that [Republicans] are on the side of the wealthy and the secure while [they] create hell for the poor. #MeToo #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":30.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":30,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":30.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951534725557927936","date":1515698531000,"rawContent":"Somehow this madness must cease. We must stop now. I speak as a child of God and [sister] to the suffering poor [and oppressed] of [this country].#MeToo #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":31.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":31,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":31.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951536456710815744","date":1515698944000,"rawContent":"I speak as a citizen of the world 4 the world as it stands aghast at the path we have taken.I speak as an American to the leaders of my own nation[@SenSanders @KamalaHarris @SenGillibrand]The great initiative in this war is ours.The initiative to stop it must be ours.#MeToo #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":32.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":32,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":32.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951536455595171840","date":1515698944000,"rawContent":"I speak [of] the poor [and oppressed] of America who are paying the double price of smashed hopes,  [heavy criticism, and prejudice]. #metoo #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":33.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":33,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":33.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951538739259437056","date":1515699488000,"rawContent":"The situation is one in which we must be ready to turn sharply from our present ways.\nIn order to atone for our sins and errors... we should take the initiative in bringing a halt to this tragic war on [wxmen and minorities]. #MeToo #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":34.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":34,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":34.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951538737963450368","date":1515699488000,"rawContent":"The world now demands a maturity of America that we may not be able to achieve. It demands that we admit that we have been wrong from the beginning of our [history], that we have been detrimental to the life of [wxmen and minorities]. #MeToo #BLM","userId":865645519485272065,"media":null,"username":"cnspeckhardt","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":35.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":35,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":35.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951538742526820352","date":1515699489000,"rawContent":"1. End all [attempts to suppress representation whether in the #census or #Gerrymandering or other means]